n</th>\n<td>白金狮子、狮子\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配置推荐\n</th>\n<td>技能可全点右，7、11可考虑交球\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色攻略\n</th>\n<td>【by 爱玩游戏的吐鲁番】 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WEZrBeEp6/\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WEZrBeEp6/</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">中文CV\n</th>\n<td>李婵妃\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">日文CV\n</th>\n<td>上田瞳\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配音展示\n</th>\n<td>【by ThAmeReborn】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qmZ6BREiz\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qmZ6BREiz</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色生平\n</th>\n<td>罗格妮达是伊凡大帝的心腹将领，继承了“露西亚之子”的纯正血统，是冷静严肃、一丝不苟、骄傲且完美的冰原卫队将军。在执行血统制度的露西亚帝国，罗格妮达被塑造成所有战士的标杆，忠实高效地执行着伊凡大帝赋予的使命，捍卫着露西亚帝国的秩序。\n<p>作为前任大帝阿尔曼之女，罗格妮达曾被当作“未来的冰原之主”培养。她自幼目睹冰原上争夺权力、资源的无休止冲突，亦对这一弱肉强食的规则产生了思考。10岁时，罗格妮达目睹阿尔曼被伊凡所杀，却表现出超出常人的冷静。在她眼中，这不过是弱肉强食的又一次上演，既然身处这套规则，就一定会有被更强者吞噬的那一天。\n</p><p>伊凡大帝为冰原带来了改变，以血统这一“秩序”统合了冰原之上的“混乱”，使部落归于团结、帝国走向强大统一。这使得罗格妮达成为帝国秩序的坚定捍卫者。但与此同时，罗格妮达并未停止对于这个国家的观察与思考——露西亚绝不能回到过去，那么未来，将在何方？\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>角色像素模型</th>\n<th>变身像素模型\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 50%;\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E7%BD%97%E6%A0%BC%E5%A6%AE%E8%BE%BE_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"罗格妮达 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/gklvyf0480r1hpajycjkdrcj15ptfsy.png/100px-%E7%BD%97%E6%A0%BC%E5%A6%AE%E8%BE%BE_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f5/gklvyf0480r1hpajycjkdrcj15ptfsy.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 50%;\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E7%BD%97%E6%A0%BC%E5%A6%AE%E8%BE%BE(%E9%87%91%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90)_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"罗格妮达(金狮子) 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/99/691ivpudbx26bx6hjg0hlg4hz265fya.png/100px-%E7%BD%97%E6%A0%BC%E5%A6%AE%E8%BE%BE%28%E9%87%91%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%29_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/99/691ivpudbx26bx6hjg0hlg4hz265fya.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022105452\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.256 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.459 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1731/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 51513/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6257/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 399/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  328.099      1 模板:角色\n100.00%  328.099      1 -total\n 55.21%  181.149      1 模板:技能树\n 43.85%  143.864     14 模板:技能图\n  6.93%   22.732      1 模板:面包屑\n  4.27%   14.008      1 模板:个性图\n  4.19%   13.748      1 模板:极限解放图\n  1.66%    5.432      1 模板:立绘\n  1.33%    4.361      1 模板:兵种图\n  0.74%    2.419      2 模板:阵营图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7691-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022105451 and revision id 20853. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"角色","missing":true},{"sortkey":"","category":"可邂逅角色","miss